 Text Events&#xa;OMOP CDM → One XML per Record&#xa;Random 77,200-patient Subsample" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=15;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#4CAF50;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1840" y="-8" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="11" value="Retrieve and Review Candidate EHRs&#xa;BM25 Returns Top Five per Query&#xa;Review in Rank Order · Stop at First Relevant&#xa;Same Patient Pool for Random Baseline" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1840" y="328" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="Is at Least One of the Top Five&#xa;EHRs Manually Judged Relevant?" style="rhombus;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#FF9800;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1520" y="328" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="Exclude from Grounded-response Subset&#xa;No Relevant EHR among Top Five&#xa;Instruction Remains in the 983 Catalog" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#607D8B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1520" y="632" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="Stage 3 · Write Expert Response&#xa;Prefer Same-specialty Non-author&#xa;Check Feasibility + EHR Sufficiency&#xa;Answer at the Latest EHR Timestamp" styl